For creating React Vite Project
================================

React Commands
===============

To create a modern React project, the industry-standard recommendation is to use Vite.

npx create-vite@latest <DigitalClockReact> --template react

npm create vite@latest my-react-app -- --template react

npm run dev

npm init -y

npm run build

npm run preview

=================================================================================================================================================================

Shortcut for creating react class component

1) rcc
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

rfce: Generates a regular React Functional Component with an export default at the bottom.

rfc: Generates a regular React Functional Component with a named export.


